BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 662.0 Tm (rotating media. Bitmaps represent allocated blocks and inodes, avoiding a single FAT-like) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 645.0 Tm (allocation chain. A file's inode points to data blocks or indirect blocks, and free-space) Tj ET
